Proposal, not applied by any build: let a board name its touch panel and axis maxima for drivers/NativeHidInput of UniXNU.
Apply in the UniXNU checkout with: git apply patches/NativeHidInput/0001-panel-and-axis-boot-args.patch (paths are relative to UniXNU).
fajita boot arguments with it: native-touch-panel-w=1080 native-touch-panel-h=2340 native-touch-edge-px=64 (axes unchanged: the
fajita probe publishes in the 30480 x 20320 units NativeHidInput already uses). See NOTES-touch.md.

